00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:22.120
And I'm Dick Smothers, and the show you're about to see is from February 16th, 1969.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:25.480
That's February 16th, 1969.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.180
That's right. And it earned an Emmy for our writers.

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:29.340
An Emmy for our writers.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.480
