00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:57.340
do that? I have no idea. Our guests on February 16th, 1969 were comedian David Fry, Liberace

00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:59.160
in the musical group Hedge and Donna.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:04.140
Fry was a very talented impressionist and a topical comedian.

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:10.080
