00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:10.920
Lyndon Johnson.

00:01:11.330 --> 00:01:20.550
I shall not seek and I will not accept the nomination of my party for another term as

00:01:20.550 --> 00:01:21.070
your president.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:29.540
Tomorrow I will be just another private citizen, no different from any other private citizen.

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.390
Who is an ex-king.

00:01:33.210 --> 00:01:35.840
The new president, Richard Nixon.

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:40.940
But in 1968, we have fielded the greatest volunteer army in history.

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:43.670
And I want to be very clear about this, you just president.

00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:47.690
Former vice president, Hubert Humphrey.

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:50.720
