00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:19.940
I don't pussyfoot on anything. I call a spade a spade.

00:02:20.100 --> 00:02:23.400
This show was taped right after the 1968 election.

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:27.180
Now, Liberace was one of the greatest showmen of all time.

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:29.960
He was a very popular and flamboyant concert pianist.

